      "id": "claim_aac8685b84d54622b3a14df7c5281d5c",
      "statement": "The TraceLinkTypes record defines exactly four pipelines — SAD_SAM_CODE (TransArC), SAD_SAM (SWATTR), SAD_CODE (ArDoCode), SAM_CODE (ArCoTL) — each with name, alternative_name, api_name, info, a checkCondition predicate over uploaded files controlling selectability, providedFiles, and resultViewOptions; architecture model presence is satisfied by either PCM or UML, and canFindInconsistencies (documentation + architecture model) is exported alongside the pipeline helpers.",
